    '4. Desert with Ritika: Low Rainfall, Cactus & Camels, Mud Houses, Tankas & Jaisalmer Fort',
    '5. Coast with Chandni: Puri Beaches, Fishing Livelihoods, Shankh, Rath Yatra & Cyclone Safety',
    '6. Activity 3: Identifying Coastal Organisms (Sea Turtle, Crab, Dolphin, Corals, Seaweed)',
    '7. Mountains with Nayan: Sikkim Peaks, Yaks, Pine/Oak Trees, Bakhu/Thukpa & Loosong Festival',
    '8. Mountain Architecture & Hazards: Wooden Sloping Roofs & Monsoon Landslide Resilience',
    '9. Life in My Landform: Connecting Regional Concepts to Students\' Own Local Surroundings',
    '10. Let Us Reflect: Comprehensive 4-Region Synthesis Matrix (Plains vs Desert vs Coast vs Mountains)',
