    'Chandni waking up at 7:00 AM in Puri to watch fishermen launching their wooden boats into ocean waves.',
    'Nayan riding a shaggy yak on steep mountain trails in Sikkim and enjoying hot thukpa noodle soup on a cold evening.',
    'Lamas in colourful traditional robes performing the Chaam mask dance during Loosong in Sikkim.',
