    'Why do traditional houses in Sikkim have sloping roofs? (2 marks)',
    'Name the primary livelihood of coastal people and mention two marine animals (2 marks)',
    'Name two festivals: one celebrated in Sikkim and one celebrated in Puri (2 marks)',
